    <statement><p>Calculate <m>\bf{v} \times \bf{w}</m>:</p>
<p><m>\mathbf{v}=\left\lt 8,2,2\right&gt;,\quad \mathbf{w}=\left\lt 2,2,4\right&gt;</m></p>
<p><m>\mathbf{v}\times \mathbf{w} =</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>4\boldsymbol{i}+-28\boldsymbol{j}+12\boldsymbol{k}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><m>\left|\begin{array}{ccc}
 \boldsymbol{i} \amp  \boldsymbol{j} \amp  \boldsymbol{k} \\
 8 \amp  2 \amp  2 \\
 2 \amp  2 \amp  4 
\end{array} \right|
= 
\left| \begin{array}{ccc}
 2 \amp  2 \\
 2 \amp  4 
\end{array} \right| \boldsymbol{i}
-  \left| \begin{array}{ccc}
 8 \amp  2 \\
 2 \amp  4  \end{array} \right| \boldsymbol{j}
+ \left| \begin{array}{ccc}
 8 \amp  2 \\
 2 \amp  2  \end{array} \right| \boldsymbol{k}</m>





<m>\qquad = \left(2\cdot 4-2\cdot 2\right) \boldsymbol{i} - \left(8\cdot 4-2\cdot 2\right) \boldsymbol{j} + \left(8\cdot 2-2\cdot 2\right) \boldsymbol{k}</m>





<m>\qquad = 4\boldsymbol{i}-28\boldsymbol{j}+12\boldsymbol{k}</m>



</solution>
